## Design Philosophy

This project intentionally avoids overwhelming users with dashboards.

Instead it focuses on:

- exploration
- storytelling
- interaction
- systems thinking

Every chart should answer a question.

Every interaction should reveal a relationship.

Every section should help users understand why climate impacts differ across communities.

